<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66638" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταδῐδάσκω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>teach new things, show a better way</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				9.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>: c.acc., <i>convert</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.657
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλιν λόγῳ μεταδιδάξαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					1.15
				</span></i>
			: c. dupl. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. τινὰ ἑτέραν ὄρχησιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Im.</u>
					2.11
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταμανθάνω</span>
			, <i>learn differently, learn something new</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Muson.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				10p.56H.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.784b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. τὴν διάλεκτον τὴν Δωρίδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paus.
					4.27.11
				</span></i>
			; also, <i>change one's mind</i> for the worse, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				13.28
			</span></i>: more freq. for the better, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				21.21
			</span></i>, al.</div>
